WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Well, it's it's it's not like I'm trying

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.720
to, you know, show you any type of

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.400
affection or anything. It's just that

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.960
I thought maybe I would try it

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.400
considering, you know,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.400
since you were throwing bread at me.
